WEBVTT

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:40.660
The group who stole the stone tablet
are aiming to steal the four Sacred Beasts.

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:50.210
And Ozma's team are about
to attempt to seal them.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:55.800
The battle for the four
Sacred Beasts is about to intensify.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:12.130
This is the ancient language
inscribed on the stone tablet.

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:16.960
It appears that it was used many years
ago, deep in the heart of China.

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:19.150
So what's on it?

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:23.800
"We hereby seal the Sacred Beasts
to maintain the natural order."

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:26.610
Seal the Sacred Beasts?

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:28.610
What's that mean, old man?

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:30.490
We're not sure yet.

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:36.210
But "seal" means that Sacred Beasts
weren't originally from the tablet, right?

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.700
That seems to
be the case.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:40.810
That's all ancient history.

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:45.580
There are still people who
use this ancient language.

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:47.030
Really?

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:48.290
Yes.

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:51.440
Isn't that...

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:54.370
The same clothes
Ozma's group wears!

00:02:54.370 --> 00:03:01.510
Those are the kids who backed
you all up in the Battle Tower, yes?

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:02.640
Yeah.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:06.120
Ozma did mention
something like...

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.210
To seal the
four Sacred Beasts.

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.510
That is the mission
given to us by our clan.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:20.910
Are they the ones who sealed
Sacred Beasts inside the stone tablet?

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:24.440
That's a distinct possibility.

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:34.660
What does Ozma's team
have to do with the stone tablet?

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:39.880
Dang! If we knew their hideout,
we could just bust right in and ask 'em!

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:40.880
Takao!

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:42.920
There!

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.660
Yusuf!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:49.830
Yo! We let you
get away last time.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.640
But now, we challenge you!
This time with no interruptions!

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:54.530
Anytime!

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:57.650
We've got questions
to ask this time, too!

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:04.150
Questions? Well, whatever.

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:05.550
Follow me.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:09.540
You've got guts.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:14.270
Odd for you to come out all this
way just to lose your Sacred Beasts.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:18.730
"We hereby seal the Sacred Beasts
to maintain the natural order."

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:21.370
How do you know that phrase?

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:25.280
So you do have something to
do with the stone tablet, then?

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:28.600
What's all this about
sealing Sacred Beasts?

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:31.140
Ozma!

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.240
Do you really want to know?

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.250
Yeah.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.750
Then allow me!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.630
Ozma! They don't need to know nothin'!

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.030
It's fine.

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:47.610
I'd feel bad if we sealed their
Sacred Beasts without telling them.

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:53.800
The story I'm about to tell you
is from thousands of years ago.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:58.000
Sacred Beasts were a source of
blessings that resided across the land.

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:31.400
Sacred Beasts enriched the land, yet
humanity saw them as beings to be feared.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:34.590
But they lived
alongside each other.

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:41.600
One day, someone with the ability to
command the Sacred Beasts appeared.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:51.620
They abused the power of the Sacred
Beasts to obtain everything they wanted.

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:57.010
The Sacred Beasts changed from being gods
that brought blessing to gods of destruction.

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:07.050
And that's when our ancestors found
a way to seal the Sacred Beasts.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:12.890
They traveled to distant lands to
seal these corrupted Sacred Beasts.

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:21.010
The wicked ones from our clan who
had their Sacred Beasts sealed

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:26.560
planned to use the four Sacred Beasts, the ultimate rulers of all creation.

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:30.340
Genbu, black tortoise
of the water.

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:32.130
Byakko, the white
tiger of gold.

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:33.970
Suzaku, vermilion
bird the of flames.

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:36.760
And Seiryu, the azure
dragon of wood.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:47.700
Our clan tried to seal them
before they could be used for evil.

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:58.750
But the power of the four Sacred Beasts
was too strong. They failed to seal them.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.590
And the four Sacred
Beasts disappeared.

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:05.540
But in case they
ever returned,

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:10.510
the sealing technique has been passed
down from generation to generation.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.170
And that's why you want
to seal our four Sacred Beasts?

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:18.890
Is that the mission you
were talking about?

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.210
Exactly.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:24.000
I had no idea the Sacred Beasts
had such a history behind them...

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.180
Get it now?

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:29.700
Sacred Beasts aren't
your playthings.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:33.120
So hand over the Sacred
Beasts and get a move on.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:34.270
Never!

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:36.050
What?!

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:39.480
I don't care about gods of
blessing or destruction or whatever!

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:44.420
You expect us to nod our heads and say "Oh, I see!" after hearing all that ancient history?

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:45.790
He's right!

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:49.530
We don't care what they were like
before, because now they're with us!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.750
We're not giving our
Sacred Beasts to you!

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:55.310
Talking was a
waste of time.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:58.900
Which means I'll
take 'em by force!

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:02.120
With my new Voltic Ape!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.450
Whoever wants to be its
first victim better step up!

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:07.140
Okay, I'll take you on.

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:09.120
Ahh--hey, Rei!

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:17.010
You've got guts for stepping
up just to lose Byakko.

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:20.100
You can talk big
after you've won!

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:21.940
Come on!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:27.370
--Three! Two! One!

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:29.330
--Go, Shoot!

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:39.380
What?!

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.410
He blew Driger back!

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:46.790
You're gonna need more power
than that to beat my new Bey!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.880
Go, Driger!

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:54.780
No!

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:57.140
Kyoujyu, what's going on?

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:00.860
This new Voltic Ape has
a defense ring equipped,

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:02.890
so its defense has
been increased considerably!

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:05.300
Now it's my turn!

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:24.570
Hurry up and
finish this, Dunga!

00:09:24.570 --> 00:09:27.370
Go, Voltic Ape!

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:34.720
Byakko!

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:46.400
There it is!
Byakko's mine!

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:47.850
Take it if you dare!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.440
Go, Voltic Ape!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.520
Rei, you can do it!
Don't lose to him!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.480
Finish this!

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:27.010
Spark Hammer!

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:02.670
Byakko's mine!
Just like I said!

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:07.640
Rei!

00:11:08.340 --> 00:11:10.820
Don't just stand there!
Dunga, let's move!

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:15.120
Rei, are you okay?

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:16.850
Rei...

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:18.870
Byakko...

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:34.460
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:49.030
What? Byakko was taken?

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:52.750
What now?

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.550
Don't just sit there! Analysis!

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:01.530
Choose this one.
Extract it immediately.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:06.620
We haven't finished
analyzing this Sacred Beast yet.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.090
Then finish it!

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:12.470
They're not going
to get ahead of us!

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:16.210
The remaining
three will be mine...

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:23.970
The time we've been
waiting for has finally come.

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:26.770
It sure did take a while.

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:30.190
But thanks to that
Byakko has evolved quite a bit.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:36.080
Once we seal it in the tablet, it
shouldn't evolve any more than it has.

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:40.320
As long as it doesn't evolve, Byakko
shouldn't be able to break the seal.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:44.350
So Byakko will be sealed
within the tablet for eternity.

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:45.820
Let's begin.

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:50.600
In the name of the Saint Shields,
we hereby seal Byakko!

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:53.230
--In the name of the Saint Shields!
--In the name of the Saint Shields!

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:57.650
--Go, Shoot!

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:03.690
Here it comes!

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:11.060
Byakko!

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:15.910
Byakko! Return to the tablet!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:30.170
We finally sealed Byakko.

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:31.130
Yeah.

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:34.160
Now we just need Genbu,
Suzaku, and Seiryu.

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:45.950
After analyzing Rei and Dunga's battle,
I've concluded that Driger lost

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:48.480
because of a lack
of attack power.

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:53.170
There are Beys that excel
in defense like Draciel.

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:55.700
But you can't win
on defense alone.

00:13:55.840 --> 00:14:00.510
Which means if we want to win we
have to increase our attack power.

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:04.660
Yes. Which is why I came
up with this training regimen!

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:07.270
We just have to
break those, right?

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:13.150
If you can break all of them, consider it
equivalent to breaking through Dunga's defense.

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:16.710
I ran calculations on the thickness
and distance between the boards.

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:20.120
Okay. Let's try it.

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:22.920
Yeah. We're gonna
get Byakko back!

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:24.100
--Yeah!

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:30.590
I'm up first.

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:33.640
Go, Shoot!

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:36.020
Go, Dragoon!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.320
Dang! Only eight!

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:46.640
All right, I'm next.

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:49.170
Go, Shoot!

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:55.100
Almost there!

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:56.310
Rei.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.140
You're up next.

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:00.960
Yeah...

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:06.410
Go, Shoot!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:16.740
Come on, Rei, you
totally got blown back.

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.310
Sorry.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:21.490
Maybe we started
practicing too soon.

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:23.460
You might be right.

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:26.720
He didn't even
use half his power.

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:29.020
Must have been a
real shock for him.

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:31.540
Come on, let's put
some spirit into it!

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:32.590
Yeah...

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:42.740
What's the deal?
Are you even trying, Rei?

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:45.530
Don't you want to
get Byakko back?

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:47.920
Takao, cut it out!

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:50.560
Why don't you try
thinking about how Rei feels?

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:52.970
He just lost Byakko!

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.980
That's why getting depressed
isn't gonna get him anywhere!

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:58.620
We have to get
back what we lost!

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:01.530
We gotta get stronger
to get it back!

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:04.000
Rei knows that!

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.960
Even if he does, you have
to consider how he feels!

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:08.260
Get it?

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:11.240
Nope! I don't get it! Not at all!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:12.770
Takao, you jerk!

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:14.260
That's enough!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:20.330
How could you understand how I feel
after having my Sacred Beast sealed away?!

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:23.760
Rei!

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:26.540
Leave him be, Max.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.280
Rei...

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:51.680
Will I...
Never see you again?

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:55.200
Will I never battle
alongside you again?

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.130
What am I worrying about?

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:40.790
There are plenty of excellent
Bladers without Sacred Beasts.

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:51.310
A Sacred Beast isn't everything.
I've still got Driger!

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:55.820
Go get 'em!

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:57.680
Go for it!

00:17:58.310 --> 00:17:59.720
Don't lose!

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:02.370
Let me play, too.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.910
It's Rei Kon!

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.790
Here I come!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:12.980
Ready!

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:16.610
I get to battle Rei Kon!
It's like a dream come true!

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:20.400
Right. Even without
my Sacred Beast...

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:23.870
--Three! Two! One!
--Three! Two! One!

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.800
--Go, Shoot!
--Go, Shoot!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.290
What's this feeling?

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:39.810
It's like my heart's
been ripped wide open.

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:45.380
Byakko... We've always
fought together.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:47.920
But with you
separated from Driger...

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.720
Come back, Byakko!

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:52.790
Just stay with me!

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:55.710
Please... Come back!

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:03.030
Go, Zeronix!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:08.020
Yes!

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:09.430
Zeo!

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:10.960
Rei!

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:16.510
Rei, do you need something?

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:19.620
It's nothing.

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:21.010
Keep up the good work.

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:23.810
Rei...

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:26.930
That's weird...

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:35.610
Tell me, Byakko...

00:19:36.060 --> 00:19:37.990
What should I do?

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:40.610
Kai.

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:44.930
How long are you
going to keep this up?

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:49.660
You aren't the only one
hurt by losing Byakko.

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.860
Come on.
Let's head back.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:57.000
Go, Shoot!

00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:59.080
Go, Draciel!

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:07.490
So close!

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:10.960
But you're getting there, Max!

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:13.450
Okay! I'm next!

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:16.210
Yeah... This time for sure!

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:20.570
Have they been
at it all day?

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:23.560
Go, Shoot!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.480
Go, Dragoon!

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:34.850
Rei... We will
get Byakko back.

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:37.890
So please, hang in there!

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:49.350
Not yet, huh?

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.900
I'll go next.

00:20:53.220 --> 00:20:54.700
Rei!

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:03.880
They're ready, Rei.

00:21:04.260 --> 00:21:06.130
Byakko is gone.

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:09.710
But I still have my friends.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:12.320
I can't falter here.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.730
I'm going to fight.
For everyone.

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:18.420
And for Byakko as well!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:21.610
Go, Shoot!!

00:23:00.340 --> 00:23:04.260
The next tablet Sacred
Beast comes after Takao.

00:23:04.260 --> 00:23:07.360
What will Zeo, who only thinks
of Sacred Beasts as mere tools,

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:11.020
learn after seeing Takao
and Seiryu fight together?

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:13.050
The next episode's just
a stone's throw away!

00:23:13.050 --> 00:23:14.580
What is it, Chairman?

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:16.570
Paper covers rock?

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:18.880
Gosh, Chairman!
This isn't rock-paper-scissors!

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:21.620
There's a limit to how
many puns you can make!
